“ (github.com/atanasster/electionsbg, лиценз MIT)<!-- -->. Пълните стенограми са в <a href=\"https://www.parliament.bg/bg/plenaryst\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">parliament.bg</a>. <a href=\"/metodologiya\">Как работим</a>.</p></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"bg-surface border-t border-rule mt-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 text-sm text-muted grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2\"><p>Не подкрепяме партия, кандидат или правителство. Всяко число има източник и дата.<!-- --> <a href=\"/metodologiya\">Как работим</a> · <a href=\"/rechnik\">Речник</a> · <a href=\"/sastoyanie\">Състояние на данните</a> · <!--$?--><template id=\"B:1\"></template><a href=\"/metodologiya#greshki\">Съобщи за грешка</a><!--/$--></p><p class=\"sm:text-right\">Вътрешен прототип · данните са към датите, посочени до тях</p></div></footer><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script id=\"_R_\">(globalThis[\"TURBOPACK\"] || (globalThis[\"TURBOPACK\"] = [])).push({\"otherChunks\":[\"static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\",\"static/chunks/2vy51v46dlsq-.js\",\"static/chunks/2bx7ggprk0oi5.js\",\"static/chunks/0c1ad7rcpjghx.js\"],\"runtimeModuleIds\":[94553]});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" async=\"\"></script><div hidden id=\"S:0\"><header class=\"bg-deep text-white border-b border-white/10 sticky top-0 z-40 lg:static\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 flex items-center gap-x-8 h-14 lg:h-auto lg:py-4\"><a class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block w-3 h-3 bg-red\"></span><span class=\"text-[1.35rem] lg:text-[1.6rem] font-bold tracking-tight\">Осъзнатост</span></a><nav aria-label=\"Основно меню\" class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-x-5 text-[15px] flex-1\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Кой решава, как се приемат законите, сигнали\" class=\"no-underli